{"work_id":"manohara","scene_id":"manohara-s031","scene_ordinal":31,"transition_audit_id":"T031","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/manohara/scenes/scene-031.md","record_count":7,"records":[{"id":"manohara-s031-d001","scene_id":"manohara-s031","scene_ordinal":31,"transition_audit_id":"T031","speaker_label":"மனோகரன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அம்மா... அம்மா... அம்மா... துள்ளிவரும் வேல் ஆவேசத்தை அள்ளிவரும் வாள் அவைகளை எல்லாம் தடுத்திருக்கிறேன். அவைகளைவிடப் பெரியவளா என்னை நகையாடிய இந்த கள்ளி? ஆனால் அவளைத்தான் எதிர்க்க முடியாமல் ஓடி வந்திருக்கிறேன். யாராலம்மா? தங்களால் — தங்கள் கட்டளையால் — சத்தியத்தால்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":43,"printed_page":42}],"source_scene_file":"scene-031.md"},{"id":"manohara-s031-d002","scene_id":"manohara-s031","scene_ordinal":31,"transition_audit_id":"T031","speaker_label":"பத்மாவதி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மனோகரா! விஷயத்தைச் சொல்! என்ன நடந்தது?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":43,"printed_page":42}],"source_scene_file":"scene-031.md"},{"id":"manohara-s031-d003","scene_id":"manohara-s031","scene_ordinal":31,"transition_audit_id":"T031","speaker_label":"மனோ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"தன்மானம் தரைமட்டமானது, வீரம் விலை கூறப்பட்டது. அவமானச் சின்னம் ஆணவத்தால் ஆடியது! அம்மா! தங்கள் கட்டளையை உடனே மாற்றிக் கொள்ளவேண்டும்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":43,"printed_page":42}],"source_scene_file":"scene-031.md"},{"id":"manohara-s031-d004","scene_id":"manohara-s031","scene_ordinal":31,"transition_audit_id":"T031","speaker_label":"பத்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சத்தியம் செய்திருக்கிறாய் செல்வா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":43,"printed_page":42}],"source_scene_file":"scene-031.md"},{"id":"manohara-s031-d005","scene_id":"manohara-s031","scene_ordinal":31,"transition_audit_id":"T031","speaker_label":"மனோ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வீரன் கோழையாவதா? துடிக்கும் தோள்கள் துவண்டுபோவதா? வேண்டாம்... அந்த விபரீத சத்தியத்தை நான் காப்பாற்றவேண்டாம்......","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":43,"printed_page":42}],"source_scene_file":"scene-031.md"},{"id":"manohara-s031-d006","scene_id":"manohara-s031","scene_ordinal":31,"transition_audit_id":"T031","speaker_label":"பத்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்ன நடந்தது விஜயா...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":43,"printed_page":42}],"source_scene_file":"scene-031.md"},{"id":"manohara-s031-d007","scene_id":"manohara-s031","scene_ordinal":31,"transition_audit_id":"T031","speaker_label":"விஜ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அந்தப் பாதகி வசந்தசேனை (விம்மி அழுகிறாள்)","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":43,"printed_page":42}],"source_scene_file":"scene-031.md"}]}